              {
                "description": "Modifies concurrent-insert processing. If it is set to AUTO (the default value), MySQL permits INSERT and SELECT statements to run concurrently for MyISAM tables that have no free blocks in the middle of the data file concurrent_insert. If it is set to NEVER, concurrent inserts are disabled. If it is set to ALWAYS, concurrent inserts are allowed for all MyISAM tables, even those whose rows are deleted.",
