              {
                "description": "Password policy executed by validate_password. If this parameter is set to LOW, the system will check whether passwords satisfy the criteria of validate_password.length. If it is set to MEDIUM, the system will check whether passwords satisfy the criteria of validate_password.length, validate_password.number_count, validate_password.mixed_case_count, and validate_password.special_char_count. If it is set to STRONG, the system will check whether passwords satisfy the criteria of validate_password.length, validate_password.number_count, validate_password.mixed_case_count, validate_password.special_char_count, and validate_password.dictionary_file.",
                "name": "validate_password.policy",
